    "description": "<p>Fully annotated dataset for training of 3D segmentation models. We provide the Raw image patches in the Raw directory and instance segmentation labels in the RealMask directory, the semantic segmentation masks are provided in the BinaryMask directory. Manually curated from originally published dataset over here: http://celltrackingchallenge.net/3d-datasets/ by team at Kapoorlabs.</p>",
